OL,3,GNEWSANeighbour killed over noise
OL,4,Adispute, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man stabbed his neighbour to death
OL,7,Fafter making repeated complaints about
OL,8,Fnoise, a jury was told.
OL,10,FNigel Booth, 67, died at his flat in
OL,11,FStamford, Lincolnshire, after he was
OL,12,Fattacked by Andrew Greengrass, 37, who
OL,13,Flived downstairs.
OL,15,FA murder trial at Lincoln Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard that Booth received more than 20
OL,17,Fwounds from a knife, including some
OL,18,Fthat penetrated his heart.
OL,20,FGreengrass, of Foundry Road, Stamford,
OL,21,Fhas admitted killing his neighbour, but
OL,22,Fdenies murder claiming he lost control.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
